        <body>
            <div xml:id="d118">

                <pb facs="0148" n="76" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg76"/>

                <head>Admirers of the Universe Lodge</head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>Paris</placeName>, <date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-volume-rules" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1865-07-31T23:59:59+00:09" notBefore="1865-04-15T00:00:00+00:09"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The respectable lodge, Admirers of the
                    Universe, Orient of Paris, joining in the sentiments expressed by the whole
                    fraternity in France, begs you to receive their regrets at the horrible crime
                    that has taken from a great nation its first citizen, and added to the martyr
                    list of humanity the pure and glorious name of Abraham Lincoln.</p>
                <p>The respectable lodge has decided that a salute shall be given in sign of
                    mourning, for ten years, on the anniversary of the mournful event.</p>
                <p>This first tribute paid to the memory of Brother Abraham Lincoln, the lodge
                    expresses its confidence in the eminent qualities of his successor Mr. Johnson,
                    and is pleased to see in his love of justice the qualities of heart that augur a
                    peaceable administration.</p>
                <p>The lodge requests you to be the interpreter of its sentiments to the great
                    American nation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LEBARE.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bigelow</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">U S.
                            Minister, Paris</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
